$ Milestone 6, §3.6: a module that itself `bring`s another module,
$ exercising the transitive/diamond case (main.fly also brings `geometry`
$ directly -- driver.cpp's ModuleMerger must not double-declare it).

bring geometry

job describeRectangle(width, height) {
    a = area(width, height)
    p = perimeter(width, height)
    give "{width}x{height} rectangle: area={a} perimeter={p}"
}
